    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d234">

                <pb facs="0340" n="174" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg174"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.77/1579</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Reinsch to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-01T13:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 1, 1917, 1 p.m</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Minister of Communication has assigned Siems-Carey Company under its contract
                    an additional line from Chowkiakow, the chief commercial center of eastern
                    Honan, to Siangyang, ditto, of northern Hupeh; surveying party is being
                    sent.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
